---
output: pdf
---
@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam sequence {
	ArrowColor #C00000
	ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFE0A0
}
participant Alice #FFD700
participant Bob #LightBlue
Alice -> Bob : Hello <color:red>red</color>, <color:green>green</color>, <b>bold</b>, <i>italic</i>
note over Alice, Bob #80FF8080 : Semi-transparent note
Bob --> Alice : <u>underlined</u> and <s>striked</s>
@enduml
